(text "WIZ850io: one footprint with both 1x6 sockets (J1 = pads 1-6, J2 = pads 7-12), rows 17.78 mm (0.7 in) apart." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4bd3a685-210c-4ed2-8605-a9271ad3a916))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc103ad2-eb79-405c-9a85-023cc1cc9bee))
(text "microSD on the ESP32-S3 SD host, 1-bit mode. JP1 can disconnect DAT0 from GPIO3 (a strapping pin) if it upsets boot." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c46ff305-13d5-42a4-af8f-f5c6f89b39b9))
